SKILL.md	md	line	run `node <repo>/_shared/a1-tools.cjs feature plan-steps <spec-path>` and
SKILL.md	md	line	follow its `steps[]`. The list holds every fixed step and every conditional
SKILL.md	md	line	step; a step with `when` runs when its phase workflow finds that condition
SKILL.md	md	line	true. On S that is one Rene spawn on the reasoning tier (opus) for
SKILL.md	md	line	Discover+Specify+Clarify, resumed via `SendMessage` for Gate C's dispatch and
SKILL.md	md	line	for the single-wave plan (its `resume` list): no Vincente, no Diana, no Tobi.
SKILL.md	md	line	Gate C, Gate 4.5, Scope-Claim, Isolation and the pr-review Reinhard run at
SKILL.md	md	line	every size. When Rene's discovery shows the feature is not S, set
SKILL.md	md	line	`spec set-size` and re-run `plan-steps`.
