SKILL.md	md	insert-after	transition.
SKILL.md	md	line	
SKILL.md	md	line	After the merge, `feature close --by <spec-id> --pr <n>` (called from
SKILL.md	md	line	`a1-pr-review` `workflows/05-merge.md`) checks that the PR is MERGED and the
SKILL.md	md	line	remote branch is gone, records every gate-log scope, exits the worktree,
SKILL.md	md	line	advances `merge` and `origin-cleanup`, releases the scope and sets the spec
SKILL.md	md	line	`done`. When its output names `reservations_commit_pending`, the skill then
SKILL.md	md	line	commits `.a1/reservations.json` (push-cadence P3). A second call is a no-op,
SKILL.md	md	line	and `feature close --cleanup-only` cleans branches in other clones.
